# (build 138d) "Please look -- overlap the graphs": the library's graph
# with its hidden lines. The graph's palette (portrait_library_graph.png,
# line 1) paints entries 5, 8 and 10-14 the background's dark blue; after
# $1012, loc_C4B2 (ps2.asm:18022) puts library_graph_overlay.png straight
# into the live line 1 (PaletteLoad2 -- PaletteLoad1 is the one that adds
# $80 for the fade target), and the lines show in white, cyan and red
# under $1013. Until 138d the port took it for a target-only load and left
# it out. paseo_recorder_key_tube's way to the graph. Fails on 138c.

start slot 1 routes/saves/paseo_recorder.json
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4 32 17
expect item Recorder 0
walk up 2
wait screen building
wait idle
expect script $0D04          # the desk: "This must get to the governor!"
press c
wait idle
expect script $1107
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect script $1108
expect script $1109
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect script $1010          # the library: the Recorder played
expect script $1011
expect script $1012
expect pixel 211 66 $A22     # a hidden line: the background's blue
press c
wait idle
press c
wait idle
expect pixel 211 66 $EEE     # the overlay: the line shows (before 138d $A22)
